OL,3,GNEWSATeen's brain haemorrhage began
OL,4,Awith headache at a party
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow a first aid training course is
OL,7,Fbeing held in her memory, offering
OL,8,Fpotentially life-saving skills while
OL,9,Falso raising money for The Brain
OL,10,FCharity - an event that her mum said
OL,11,Fhad left her proud and humbled.
